   "date": "2026-09-26T15:12:35-05:00",
   "body": "A new quest for the caster kobolds that wear blue jackets found both inside and outside [b]Jasperlode Mine[/b]. I personally found reliable respawns in the [b]camp with 2 tents[/b], as the only type of mob that kept respawning there was a Geomancer.\n\nNotably, these kobolds have a newly introduced drop: [item=250976]. If you're an aspiring alchemist, make sure you stay there long enough to loot it. Enchanters can also do this quest in tandem with [quest=91753].\n\n[b]Leads to: [quest=91724][/b]",
